        <mxCell id="c52" value="&lt;i&gt;The six ledger lines add up to the growth of 947,709.56 from 2024 to 2026. Payroll charged to 1090 is 966,846.03, more than the whole growth, and the other five lines net to −19,136.47. Closes are left out of every line. The axis starts at zero, so the small lines are thin: their labels give the amounts.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="404" width="860" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
